!   trace-wide.allspeak — a third instrumented script, for a recording that spans many lines.
!
!   `trace-run.allspeak` spans twenty lines and `trace-fixture.allspeak` three, which is enough to
!   say the recorder works and not enough to exercise a zoom: the Graph pane will not zoom in past
!   the point where a source line is already as tall as the text is drawn, so a short run has no
!   vertical zoom in it at all. This one walks a chain of labels across the whole file, skipping
!   every fifth jump and calling out to a helper on every seventh step, so the recording carries
!   calls and returns as well as anchors.
!
!       python3 tools/asviz-run.py --run --trace=/tmp/trace-wide.json tools/trace-wide.allspeak

    variable N
Main:
    put 0 into N
    viz start
    go to Step01

Step01:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step02

Step02:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step03

Step03:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step04

Step04:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step05

Step05:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step07

Step07:
    add 1 to N
    gosub to Helper
    go to Step08

Step08:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step09

Step09:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step10

Step10:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step12

Step12:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step13

Step13:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step14

Step14:
    add 1 to N
    gosub to Helper
    go to Step15

Step15:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step17

Step17:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step18

Step18:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step19

Step19:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step20

Step20:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step22

Step22:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step23

Step23:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step24

Step24:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step25

Step25:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step27

Step27:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step28

Step28:
    add 1 to N
    gosub to Helper
    go to Step29

Step29:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step30

Step30:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step32

Step32:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step33

Step33:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step34

Step34:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step35

Step35:
    add 1 to N
    gosub to Helper
    go to Step37

Step37:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step38

Step38:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step39

Step39:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step40

Step40:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step42

Step42:
    add 1 to N
    gosub to Helper
    go to Step43

Step43:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step44

Step44:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step45

Step45:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step47

Step47:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step48

Step48:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step49

Step49:
    add 1 to N
    gosub to Helper
    go to Step50

Step50:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step52

Step52:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step53

Step53:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step54

Step54:
    add 1 to N
    go to Step55

Step55:
    add 1 to N
    go to Done

Done:
    viz stop
    print N
    stop

Helper:
    add 1 to N
    return
